20. Performance Complexity (Interview Expected)
| Operation | ArrayList | LinkedList |
| --------- | --------- | ---------- |
| get()     | O(1)      | O(n)       |
| add()     | O(1)*     | O(1)       |
| remove()  | O(n)      | O(1)       |

21. Common Tricky Interview Questions
  Q1. Can List contain null?
  ✔ Yes (except immutable lists)
  
  Q2. Difference between remove(int) and remove(Object)?
  Method overloading confusion
  
  Q3. Why CopyOnWriteArrayList is slow for writes?
  Creates new copy on every modification
  
  Q4. How to avoid ConcurrentModificationException?
  Use Iterator.remove() or concurrent collections
